  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch05-11> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-11--grok--data-existence> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch05-11--grok--data-adequacy> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Data adequacy of thompson1917-ch05-11 by Grok 4.7: 0.45" ;
